userContent.text:
Build an interactive figure using SVG.js.

CONCEPT: A pendulum's weight resolves into a component along the string (balanced by tension) and a tangential component −mg sin θ that always points back toward equilibrium, acting as the restoring force that drives oscillation.
KEY INSIGHT (what students should walk away understanding): Tension cancels only the radial part of gravity; the leftover tangential part, −mg sin θ, always points back toward the hanging position — and when θ is small enough that sin θ ≈ θ, that restoring force becomes proportional to displacement, which is exactly the definition of simple harmonic motion.
DEMO STEPS: 6 guided steps — implement the step player in #ui

